<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ravensburger</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1883</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ravensburger is a German toy and publishing company based in Ravensburg, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baden-wurttemberg">Baden-Württemberg</a>, founded in 1883 by Otto Robert Maier as a publisher of craft books and games. It is best known for its jigsaw puzzles and board games and remains one of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/europe">Europe</a>'s leading games publishers.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ravensburger.jpg" alt="Ravensburger" width="320" height="320" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Original: Unknown author Vector: Marsupilami · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ravensburger_logo.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
